{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Create a National Disability Hate Strategy for the UK",
        "additional_details": "Disability hate is rising online and in public. \r\n\r\nDisabled people are abused, questioned and targeted simply for existing. \r\n\r\nGovernment must develop a National Disability Hate Strategy with Disabled People\u2019s Organisations to prevent hate and better protect victims.",
        "background": "Develop and fund a National Disability Hate Strategy, co-produced with Disabled People\u2019s Organisations, to tackle disability hate crime, online abuse, discrimination, public stigma and improve awareness of visible and hidden disabilities.",
